<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53342" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾱρικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Carian</u>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.171
			</span></i>, al.; used for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτελής</span>,
				<i>worthless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τράγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					540
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κ. ἔλαιον</span> a kind of
			<i>salve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ophel.
				5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κ. φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ulc.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρικὴ μοῦσα</span>
			<i>funeral song, dirge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				800e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κ. αὐλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1302
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κ. μέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					69.12
				</span></i>
			 (dub. l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρική </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρίκη</span> cod.)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
			ἀσύνθετος</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύνετος</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, καὶ
			ἄμπελος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρικόν, τό</span>, <i>Carian quarter</i> in Memphis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.409.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
